                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "I am apparently in the minority, but I actually really enjoyed this game. As a long time enjoyer of the series, I can see where people get that they miss the standard formula to the ND games, but I don't think this was a bad or far fetched deviation. There was enough mystery to keep me involved. Sure some of the characters weren't as fleshed out as they are in other games, but I found them colorful enough not to lose my interest. It was nice to finally put a face to the infamous Sonny Joon. Give it a chance for yourself instead of blindly listening to the reviews. Especially if you love the series.",
